config DRM_MBX
	tristate "PowerVR MBX (OMAP2420) render node"
	depends on DRM && ARCH_OMAP2 && MMU
	select DRM_GEM_SHMEM_HELPER
	help
	  DRM render-only driver for the PowerVR MBX of the OMAP2420 (Nokia
	  N800/N810): GEM buffers in the MBX's own address spaces, and jobs
	  made of a TA stream and a render. Display stays with omapdrm.
	  Userspace is the mbx Gallium driver of Mesa.

	  If M is selected the module is called mbx.
